# Android 11 shipped with a WebView based on Chromium ~83. Google Play auto-
# updates WebView independently of the OS on virtually all real devices, but
# this floor is kept explicit so postcss-preset-env transpiles CSS that would
# otherwise silently break (invisible colors, dropped rules) on a device that
# hasn't picked up those updates. This also covers the wider range of visitor
# browsers for the planned Vercel web deployment.
Chrome >= 83
ChromeAndroid >= 83
Android >= 83
Safari >= 14
iOS >= 14
Firefox >= 78
not dead
